WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.847
A free open-source

00:00:01.659 --> 00:00:03.097
TablePlus alternative

00:00:03.216 --> 00:00:04.300
written in Rust

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:05.938
Tabletist is a

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:08.214
free MIT-licensed database

00:00:08.026 --> 00:00:09.806
client for PostgreSQL

00:00:09.889 --> 00:00:11.929
MySQL and SQLite

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.627
on macOS Linux

00:00:13.439 --> 00:00:14.440
and Windows

00:00:14.974 --> 00:00:15.787
It's written in

00:00:15.599 --> 00:00:16.554
Rust with egui

00:00:16.507 --> 00:00:17.874
with no Electron

00:00:17.686 --> 00:00:18.452
and no web

00:00:18.264 --> 00:00:18.806
view

00:00:18.945 --> 00:00:20.100
The universal Mac

00:00:19.912 --> 00:00:21.232
download is just

00:00:21.044 --> 00:00:22.459
thirty-seven megabytes

00:00:22.982 --> 00:00:23.960
It's careful with

00:00:23.772 --> 00:00:24.515
production

00:00:24.692 --> 00:00:26.000
those connections open

00:00:25.812 --> 00:00:26.661
read-only

00:00:26.744 --> 00:00:27.828
edits wait until

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:28.371
you save

00:00:28.524 --> 00:00:29.137
you can read

00:00:28.949 --> 00:00:30.033
the exact SQL

00:00:29.845 --> 00:00:30.458
first

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:31.413
and a save

00:00:31.225 --> 00:00:32.380
never overwrites a

00:00:32.192 --> 00:00:33.253
row someone else

00:00:33.065 --> 00:00:33.831
changed

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:35.364
Full story on

00:00:35.175 --> 00:00:36.071
the dashboard
